hadiths[14]{hadithnumber,text}:
"371","[AI-translation] Hamein Harun bin Ishaq ne hadees bayan ki, farmaya: hamein Abdah ne hadees bayan ki, Hisham bin Urwah se, unke waalid se, Ayesha se. Unhon ne farmaya: Hum Aal-e-Muhammad aise hote the ke ek mahina guzar jata aur hum aag nahi jalate, khorma aur paani ke siwa kuch na tha."
"372","[AI-translation] Hamein Abdullah bin Abi Ziyad ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sayyar ne hadees bayan ki, unhon ne kaha: Hamein Sahl bin Aslam ne hadees bayan ki, Yazeed bin Abi Mansoor se, Anas se, Abu Talha se, kehne lagay: Hum ne Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) se bhook ki shikayat ki aur apne paiton par pathar bandh liya. To Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne apne pait par do pathar bandh liye. Abu Eesa ne kaha: Yeh Abu Talha ki riwayat se gharib hadees hai, ise hum sirf is tarah se jaante hain. Aur unke is qawl (aur hum ne apne paiton par pathar bandh liya) ka matlab yeh hai ke un mein se koi shakhs bhook ki wajah se jahd aur kamzori ki bina apne pait par pathar bandh leta tha."
"373","[AI-translation] Haddasana Muhammad bin Ismail, qala: haddasana Adam bin Abi Iyas, qala: haddasana Shaiban Abu Mu'awiya, qala: haddasana Abdul Malik bin Umair, an Abi Salama bin Abd ir-Rahman, an Abi Huraira, qala: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam aisi ghari mein nikle jis mein wo (aam taur par) nikle nahi the, aur jis mein kisi se unki mulaqat na hoti thi. Achanak Abu Bakr aa gaye, to aap ne farmaya: Kya baat hai ke tum aa gaye, Aye Abu Bakr? Unhon ne kaha: Main Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se milne, unke chehre ko dekhne aur unhe salam karne ke liye nikla. Dair na lagi ke Umar aa gaye, to aap ne farmaya: Kya baat hai ke tum aa gaye, Aye Umar? Unhon ne kaha: Bhook, Aye Rasoolullah! Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Main bhi us mein se kuch (ehsaas) pa raha hoon. Pus wo Abu Al-Haitham bin Taihan Ansari ke ghar ki taraf chale gaye, aur wo khajooron aur bakriyon mein kaseer shakhs the, aur unka koi naukar nahi tha. Wahan pohnche to unhe na paya, unhon ne unki biwi se kaha: Tumhara shohar kahan hai? Unhon ne kaha: Hamein meetha pani lene chale gaye hain. Dair na lagi ke Abu Al-Haitham pani se bhar e qarba (mashkiza) lekar aaye, use rakh diya, phir aaye aur Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se lipat gaye aur apni maan-baap par unhe nazar karne lage. Phir unhe apni bagh ki taraf le gaye aur unke liye bichhona bicha diya. Phir ek khajoor ke pedh ki taraf gaye aur ek qinw la kar rakh diya. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tum hamare liye iske chuare chun kar nahi la sakte the? Unhon ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah! Main chahta tha ke aap khud apni pasand ke chhuare ya kache khajoor chun lein. Wo log khaye aur us pani se piye. Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Qasam hai us Zaat ki jis ke hath mein meri jaan hai, yahi wo naeem hai jiske baare mein qayamat ke din tum se poocha jayega: Thandi chhaon, acha chhuara, aur thanda pani. Phir Abu Al-Haitham unke liye khana banane chale gaye, to Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Doodh dene wali ko hargiz na zubah karna. Unhon ne unke liye anaaq ya jadee zubah kiya, use lekar aaye, to sab ne khaya. Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Kya tumhare paas koi naukar hai? Unhon ne kaha: Nahi. Aap ne farmaya: Jab hamare paas koi qaidi aaye, to tum hamein aa milna. Phir Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke paas do (qaidi) laye gaye jin ke sath teesra koi nahi tha. Abu Al-Haitham aa gaye. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: In dono mein se kisi ko chun lo. Unhon ne kaha: Aye Rasoolullah! Aap mere liye chun lein. Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Mashwara maangne wala amanatdaar hota hai, isey le lo, kyunke maine ise namaz padhte dekha hai, aur is ke sath achi salook kiya karna. Abu Al-Haitham apni biwi ke paas gaye aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke kalam se unhein khabar ki. Unhon ki biwi ne kaha: Tum Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke farmaye hue haq ko isey azad karne ke bina poori tarah nahi pahunch sakte. Unhon ne kaha: To phir ye azad hai. Aap sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ne farmaya: Allah Ta'ala ne koi Nabi ya Khalifa bheja nahi magar uske do khass dost hote hain: Ek dost jo use bhalai ka hukum karta hai aur bure se rokta hai, aur ek dost jo use tabahi mein daalta hai. Aur jise bure dost se bacha liya jaye to yaqeenan bache gaya."
"374","[AI-translation] Hamay Umar bin Ismail bin Mujalid bin Saeed ne waqea bayan kiya, mujhe mere walid ne Bayan se riwayat kiya, mujhe Qais bin Hazm ne riwayat kiya, kehte hain: maine Sa'd bin Abi Waqqas ko yeh kehte suna: Beshak main pehla aadmi hoon jis ne Allah ki raah mein khoon bahaya, aur beshak main pehla aadmi hoon jis ne Allah ki raah mein teer chalaya. Main khud ko dekhta hoon ke Muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke sahaba ki ek jama'at ke saath ghazwa mein jata tha, hum darakhton ke patte aur hubla ke siwa kuch nahi khate thay yahan tak ke hamare munh zakhmi ho gaye, aur hamare mein se koi waisa rakh deta tha jaise khota aur oont rakh deta hai. Aur ab Banu Asad mujhe deen mein izzat dene lage hain? Agar aisa hai to beshak main tabah ho gaya, nuqsaan uthaya aur mera amal gum ho gaya."
"375","[AI-translation] Hamay Muhammad bin Bashshar ne waqea bayan kiya, hamay Safwan bin Isa ne waqea bayan kiya, hamay Muhammad bin Amr bin Isa Abu Nu'amah Al-Adawi ne waqea bayan kiya, kehte hain: maine Khalid bin Umair aur Shuwais, Aba Ar-Raqad ko yeh kehte suna: Umar bin Al-Khattab ne Utba bin Ghazwan ko bheja aur kaha: tum aur tumhare saath jo log hain nikal paro, yahan tak ke jab tum Arab ki zameen ke aakhri hisse mein pahuncho aur Ajam ki zameen ke qareeb-trin hisse mein pahuncho. Phir aage barhe yahan tak ke jab Al-Mirbad pahunche to unhein yeh jagah mili, to unhon ne kaha: yeh kya hai? Yeh Basra hai. To woh aage chal diye yahan tak ke chhote pul ke samne pahunche, to unhon ne kaha: yahin tumhein hukm diya gaya hai, to wahan utar gaye, phir unhon ne poora waqea taweel taur par bayan kiya."
"376","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Rawh bin Aslam Abu Hatim Basri ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Hammad bin Salama ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Sabit ne, Anas se, unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ne farmaya: Main Allah ki raah mein aisa daraya gaya jaisa koi nahi daraya gaya, aur Allah ki raah mein aisa aza diya gaya jaisa kisi ko nahi diya gaya, aur mere oopar raat aur din ke darmiyan se tees guzar gaye, aur mere aur Bilal ke paas koi aisa khana nahi tha jise jigar wala khaye, magar ek cheez jo Bilal ki baghal chupa leti thi."
"377","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Abdullah bin Abdur Rahman ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Affan bin Muslim ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Aban bin Yazeed Attar ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Qatada ne, Anas bin Malik se: Ke Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ke paas roti aur gosht ka na nashta jama hua aur na khana, magar tangi ke sath."
"378","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Abd bin Humaid ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Muhammad bin Ismail bin Abi Fudaik ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Ibn Abi Dhib ne, Muslim bin Jundub se, unhone Nawfal bin Iyas Hazhali se, unhone kaha: Abdur Rahman bin Awf hamare jalees the, aur wo kya khoob jalees the, aur ek din wo hamare sath ghoom-phir kar chale, yahan tak ke jab hum unke ghar mein dakhil hue aur unhon ne dakhil hokar ghusal kiya, phir bahar aaye aur humare paas ek thaal mein roti aur gosht laya gaya, to jab wo rakhi gayi to Abdur Rahman ro diye, maine unse kaha: Ae Abu Muhammad, kya baat hai jo rula raha hai? Unhone kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) rukhsat ho gaye, aur unhone aur unke ahl-e-bait ne jo ke roti se pet bhar kar nahi khaya, pas mujhe nahi lagta ke humein ta'akhir di gayi ho us cheez ke liye jo hamare liye behtar hai."
"379","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Ahmad bin Mani' ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Rawh bin Ubada ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Zakariya bin Ishaq ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Amr bin Dinar ne, Ibn Abbas se, unhone kaha: Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) Makke mein teras saal ruke jismein unhe wahy bheji gayi, aur Madine mein das saal, aur unki wafat unhe tis aur sath saal ki umar mein hui."
"380","[AI-translation] Hum se riwayat ki Muhammad bin Bashshar ne, kaha: Hamein riwayat ki Muhammad bin Jafar ne, Shuba se, unhone Abu Ishaq se, unhone Amir bin Sad se, unhone Jarir se, unhone Muawiya se, ke unhone unhe khutba dete hue suna, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah (sallallahu alaihi wa sallam) ki wafat tis aur sath saal ki umar mein hui, aur Abu Bakr aur Umar ki bhi, aur main bhi tis aur sath saal ka hoon."
"381","[AI-translation] Hamein hadith bayan ki Husain bin Mahdi Al-Basri ne, farmaya: hamein hadith bayan ki Abdur Razzaq ne, Ibn Juraij se, Az-Zuhri se, 'Urwah se, aur 'Aisha se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka inteqaal hua aur un ki umar teesath (63) saal thi."
"382","[AI-translation] Hamein hadith bayan ki Ahmad bin Mani' aur Ya'qub bin Ibrahim Ad-Dawraqi ne, dono ne farmaya: hamein hadith bayan ki Isma'il bin 'Ulayyah ne, Khalid Al-Hazza' se, unhon ne farmaya: hamein khabar di 'Ammar maula Bani Hashim ne, unhon ne farmaya: maine Ibn Abbas ko kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka inteqaal hua aur un ki umar painsath (65) saal thi."
"383","[AI-translation] Hamein hadith bayan ki Muhammad bin Bashshar aur Muhammad bin Aban ne, dono ne farmaya: hamein hadith bayan ki Mu'adh bin Hisham ne, unhon ne farmaya: mujhe hadith sunai mere walid ne, Qatadah se, unhon ne Al-Hasan se, aur unhon ne Daghfal bin Hanzalah se: ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ka inteqaal hua aur un ki umar painsath (65) saal thi. Abu 'Isa farmate hain: aur Daghfal ka Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam se kuch sunna hum nahi jantay, aur wo Nabi sallallahu alaihi wa sallam ke zamane mein thay."
"384","[AI-translation] Hamein hadith bayan ki Ishaq bin Musa Al-Ansari ne, farmaya: hamein hadith bayan ki Ma'n ne, hamein hadith bayan ki Malik bin Anas ne, Rabi'ah bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se, ke unhon ne unhe kehte hue suna: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wa sallam na to bohat lambay thay aur na chotay, aur na bilkul safed thay aur na zyada sanwlay, aur na ghungrialey baal waley thay aur na bilkul seedhay, Allah Ta'ala ne unhe chalees (40) saal ki umar mein bheja, pas Makkah mein das saal aur Madinah mein das saal qiyam farmaya, aur Allah Ta'ala ne unhe saath (60) saal ki umar mein wisaat diya, aur un ke sar aur daadhi mein bees (20) safed baal nahi thay. Hamein hadith bayan ki Qutaibah bin Sa'id ne, Malik bin Anas se, unhon ne Rabi'ah bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, unhon ne Anas bin Malik se, is ki misl riwayat ki."
